Based on LFM2.5-350M-Base by Liquid AI, Inc., and Sotto by juanquivilla.
ScribeKey Fast Model Terms v1.0 (ADDITIONAL_TERMS.md) add naming and
attribution conditions. The weights also inherit LFM Open License v1.0 (LICENSE). Sotto's MIT notice is
retained verbatim below. No upstream endorsement is implied.

Changes made by ScribeKey: continued LoRA training of reconstructed Sotto v6
on 4,350 rows, BF16 merge, F16 conversion and Q8_0 quantization. The tokenizer
task template and greedy generation configuration in the BF16 package were
updated. See MODIFICATIONS.md and provenance.json for files and hashes.

